Traffic Violation Penalty Calculator
Algorithm
1. Start.
2. Enter the vehicle category and number of violations.
3. For each violation, enter the offence type and whether it is a repeat offence.
4. Calculate the fine using predefined rules.
5. Add all fines to get the total penalty.
6. Check whether the disqualification condition is met.
7. Display the total penalty and disqualification status.
8. Stop.
